    "block_map_decode": "sub_8525 computes tbl_8B64 + (block_id * 0x20); record 0x56 is the 32-byte 4x8 metatile-ID layout at CPU $9624.",
    "attribute_table_layout": "sub_85C2 reads $9BE4 + ($05CA << 8) + tile_block_id; block $56 selects $05CA=2, so its source table is $9DE4 / file 0x017DF4."
